	(text "Signal path: FPGA (3.3V LVCMOS) -> ADV7123 R[9:4] / G[9:4] / B[9:4] (low 4 bits of each color tied GND -> MSB-aligned)\nFull-scale current = 1.235V / RSET * 10.5 = 26.67 mA into 75R parallel termination -> ~700 mVpp into 75R monitor load.\nSync: HSYNC/VSYNC driven separately from FPGA via 33R series Rs. ~SYNC (pin 36) tied HIGH = composite-sync-on-green disabled.\nNative sync passes through unchanged — VGA path is pixel-clock-rate passthrough, no scan conversion (that lives on hdmi_out).\n\nTODO: verify pin numbers against ADV7123 rev D datasheet before fab; consider 75R LC pi-filter on each color channel for EMI."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 240 0)
